","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscheckboxpicker\/bodymoderatelarge(_:)","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/OUDSTheme":{"abstract":[{"text":"This is a basic theme any theme must be a subclass off, or all themes must have as ancestor.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A Swift ","type":"text"},{"code":"class","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" has been used so as to allow to easily override some attributes and have inheritance, without having for developers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to implement all tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Any properties of an overridable theme should be defined so as to provide defaults values."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"We allow this theme to be derivated and be overriden."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" can be seen as a kind of “abstract class” in ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"object oriented paradigm"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"theme contract"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" is not a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"final","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" class, its type cannot be seen as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":", that is the reason why this conformity is unchecked."}],"title":"OUDSTheme","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/oudstheme","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTheme"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\